WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.000
You know, it's going to be a big lift for us to open

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
quite a number of new locations in the next year.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
But I think this is a moment where we collectively are ready for that.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
I'm Esben Piper, and I'm building La Cabra.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
Good coffee feels alive.

00:26.000 --> 00:31.000
It's open for interpretation, open for a conversation.

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
La Cabra started as a coffee company,

00:34.000 --> 00:38.000
has grown into a wider range of expressions,

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
a space that feels alive and inspiring.

00:41.000 --> 00:44.000
Since the very beginning of La Cabra,

00:44.000 --> 00:46.000
it has been not just about maintaining the standards,

00:46.000 --> 00:48.000
but really improving on them.

00:48.000 --> 00:53.000
It's about repetition and being as close to the product as possible.

00:53.000 --> 00:57.000
We use Notion to keep decisions, responsibilities,

00:57.000 --> 01:00.000
project updates and shared knowledge in one place.

01:02.000 --> 01:05.000
I keep building and I keep dreaming because I can't stop myself.

01:05.000 --> 01:07.000
I don't know how to.
